{"id":"f8dc93fa5380b9d2","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-set-induction.md","title":"Set Induction Axiom","display":"df-set-induction — Set Induction Axiom","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-set-induction","aliases":["62-df-set-induction"],"display":"df-set-induction — Set Induction Axiom","depends_on":["[[62-df-L2]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definition I.2.4(ii); §I.3","source_pages":[4,7],"source_pdf_pages":[22,25]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-set-induction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-set-induction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-set-induction — Set Induction Axiom"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definition I.2.4(ii); §I.3"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>4</span><span>7</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>22</span><span>25</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>变量和句法见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V_S\">\\(X\\in V_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in V_N\">\\(n\\in V_N\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm I_{\\mathrm{set}}\">\\(\\mathrm I_{\\mathrm{set}}\\)</span> 在 Assertion 中引入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}induction}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm I_{\\mathrm{set}}\\coloneqq\\forall X\\bigl[(0\\in X\\land\\forall n(n\\in X\\to n+1\\in X))\\to\\forall n(n\\in X)\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}induction}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm I_{\\mathrm{set}}\\coloneqq\\forall X\\bigl[(0\\in X\\land\\forall n(n\\in X\\to n+1\\in X))\\to\\forall n(n\\in X)\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是一条句子；“对所有集合归纳”与“对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_2\">\\(L_2\\)</span> 公式的归纳模式”不同。只有在相应理解实例可用时，才可把一个公式的真值集合代入本公理。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Definition I.2.4(ii); §I.3；纸面页 4, 7；PDF 页 22, 25。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-L2]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"变量和句法见 [[62-df-L2]]；$X\\in V_S$，$n\\in V_N$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in V_S","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in V_N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm I_{\\mathrm{set}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}induction}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm I_{\\mathrm{set}}\\coloneqq\\forall X\\bigl[(0\\in X\\land\\forall n(n\\in X\\to n+1\\in X))\\to\\forall n(n\\in X)\\bigr].","display":true},{"tex":"L_2","display":false}],"bytes":1064,"backlinks":[{"id":"35af454d9caa8c9d","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"见 [[62-df-basic-axioms]] 的 $\\mathrm Q_2$、[[62-df-set-induction]] 的 $\\mathrm I_{\\mathrm{set}}$、[[62-df-ACA]] 的 $\\mathrm{ACA}(S_2)$。"},{"id":"2d44fbf8bf7ebe4d","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"基本公理、集合归纳与理解模式见 [[62-df-basic-axioms]]、[[62-df-set-induction]]、[[62-df-Pi1-CA]]。"},{"id":"ce7850ab3516c1cc","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"基本公理见 [[62-df-basic-axioms]]，集合归纳见 [[62-df-set-induction]]，完整公式类和理解模式见 [[62-df-L2]]、[[62-df-Comprehension]]。"},{"id":"c68a6ecbed6addff","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[62-df-set-induction|Set Induction Axiom]]"},{"id":"daf4a7fbfe8d8a48","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"理论与基础公理见 [[62-df-RCA0]]、[[62-df-basic-axioms]]、[[62-df-set-induction]]；$\\Delta^0_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{CA}$、$\\mathrm{B}\\Sigma^0_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{CA}$ 见 [[62-df-Delta1-CA]]、[[62-df-bounded-Sigma1-CA]]；$\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]。$B=\\mathrm Q_2\\cup\\{\\mathrm I_{\\mathrm{set}}\\}\\cup\\Delta^0_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{CA}(S_2)$。"}],"outgoing":["4c6d2d9f1999915f"]}